<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/things-3/id904237743/">Things 3</a></strong>: A task manager for organizing to-do lists.</li><br/>
<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ulysses-writing-app/id1225570693/">Ulysses</a></strong>: A writing app with tools for formatting documents.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
<br/>
<h4>Mac Game of the Year</h4><br/>
<ul><br/>
<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/big-walk/id6773484032?mt=12/">Big Walk</a></strong>: A multiplayer adventure focused on solving puzzles with friends.</li><br/>
<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/blue-prince/id6752822014?mt=12/">Blue Prince</a></strong>: A mystery game set inside an unusual mansion.</li><br/>
